{#
    The Terms page. Everything on it renders through the hooks below: the code-specific hook comes first, so its
    hookables add to, override or (with enabled: false) switch off the generic hookables of the same name, on the page
    of that one Terms.

    Variables, passed on to every hookable as its context:
    - terms: the TermsInterface
    - version: the TermsVersionInterface in force
    - translation: the version's TermsVersionTranslationInterface in the current locale, with the name and the Content
    - rendered_content: the RenderedContent of the Content, with the sanitised html and the outline of its ## headings
#}
{% extends '@SyliusShop/shared/layout/base.html.twig' %}

{% set hook = 'setono_sylius_terms.shop.terms.show' %}
{% set prefixes = [hook] %}

{% block title %}{{ translation.name }} | {{ parent() }}{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    {% hook [hook ~ '.' ~ terms.code, hook] with { terms, version, translation, rendered_content } %}
{% endblock %}
